q 0.14 0.19 0.25 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 525.676 Tm (1. Split a broad request into a small feature with observable acceptance checks.) Tj ET Q
q 0.14 0.19 0.25 rg BT /F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 506.192 Tm (2. Reuse stable project rules from AGENTS.md rather than repeating them.) Tj ET Q
